{"id":"z07-04","volume":7,"volumeTitle":"秦纪二","volumeSubtitle":"前224","index":4,"title":{"t":"始皇帝二十三年","s":"始皇帝二十三年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"秦紀二 · 前224 · 丁丑","s":"秦纪二 · 前224 · 丁丑"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"王翦打下的地面，从陈向南，一直延伸到平舆。","tokens":[{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"翦","s":"翦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"取","s":"取","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陳","s":"陈","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"南","s":"南","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"至","s":"至","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"平","s":"平","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"輿","s":"舆","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"楚人听说王翦带着更多军队前来，便把国中的士兵全部拉出来抵御；王翦却加固营垒，待在里面，不跟他们交锋。","tokens":[{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"聞","s":"闻","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"翦","s":"翦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"益","s":"益","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"軍","s":"军","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"而","s":"而","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"來","s":"来","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"乃","s":"乃","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"悉","s":"悉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"國","s":"国","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"中","s":"中","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"兵","s":"兵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"御","s":"御","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"翦","s":"翦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"堅","s":"坚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"壁","s":"壁","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"與","s":"与","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"戰","s":"战","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"楚人一次次到营前叫阵，秦军始终守在营里不出来。","tokens":[{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"數","s":"数","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"挑","s":"挑","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"戰","s":"战","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"終","s":"终","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"出","s":"出","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"王翦天天让士兵休息、洗沐，又把吃喝供给得很丰足，抚慰照料他们，并且亲自和士兵吃一样的饭。","tokens":[{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"翦","s":"翦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"日","s":"日","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"休","s":"休","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"士","s":"士","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"洗","s":"洗","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"沐","s":"沐","py":"","ctx":"","p